":{"line":2,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_attribution_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"面试责任簿等待落款","text_sha256":"600ccb6a7ca20801d607678086bc4f7e372d059c862f1cf7f1908bd4712bd654","visible_event_keys":["zg361workforceattributionfact.1"],"visible_event_roles":["title"]},{"key":"zg361workforcenormalexitfact.1.a","source":{"line":4,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_normal_exit_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"离任可以结案，旧绩效不得涂改。","text_sha256":"abd153a7bec69143cd822a5cc7514ab8b454871fb7c82f23c4c2bc2c81a2acc8","visible_event_keys":["zg361workforcenormalexitfact.1"],"visible_event_roles":["option"]},{"key":"zg361workforcenormalexitfact.1.desc","source":{"line":3,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_normal_exit_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"当事人已经正常离任：约定的五十金币补偿已经支付，任职关系已经解除，一个在岗名额也已转入冻结。此前的低档考核结论仍按原样保留；日后若要重新任用，官署会沿用这份离任记录核对资格。","text_sha256":"256a0dca78e3f2b3ec1c0c415908bbf05493929386e1f531463f71f9b99a05f4","visible_event_keys":["zg361workforcenormalexitfact.1"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361workforcenormalexitfact.1.t","source":{"line":2,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_normal_exit_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"离任手续办结","text_sha256":"3d75d4f78582ea0455a7db16bc7c46270d1c8a3764dfad7630b7e80cc49d8dc4","visible_event_keys":["zg361workforcenormalexitfact.1"],"visible_event_roles":["title"]},{"key":"zg361workforceremediationfact.1.desc","source":{"line":3,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_remediation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"案卷显示，[zg361_workforce_remediation_fact_ticket_subject.GetShortUIName] 昨日拒绝了录用。目前只保留了拒绝类别，没有拒绝时的原条款、整改后的新条款，也没有候选人的复核记录；现有事实不足以确认整改完成。","text_sha256":"a612633b96d2b73e9f8a222d88fa5c49b10909b38a0e5d74f162b0d51b58424f","visible_event_keys":["zg361workforceremediationfact.1"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361workforceremediationfact.1.fail","source":{"line":4,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_remediation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"维持冻结：现有记录不能证明整改完成","text_sha256":"3de0a39961b8e0abaa9fbcd8cdbb455ba738caa87b7f9187a45fb224f73f5a90","visible_event_keys":["zg361workforceremediationfact.1"],"visible_event_roles":["option"]},{"key":"zg361workforceremediationfact.1.reason_move","source":{"line":7,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_remediation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"已记录的拒绝类别是调动或报到条件；案卷没有可供对照的新旧调任条款。","text_sha256":"7b503640f53d1dd5e070db6c3cc50b794d778273637f9f18d138e9b1aa089e17","visible_event_keys":["zg361workforceremediationfact.1"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361workforceremediationfact.1.reason_pay","source":{"line":5,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_remediation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"已记录的拒绝类别是报酬不足；案卷没有可供对照的新旧报酬条款。","text_sha256":"fb62354bdb43f7c428c5cb89862f308c360cc28b4fb24ec2ce5162b23fc7396a","visible_event_keys":["zg361workforceremediationfact.1"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361workforceremediationfact.1.reason_role","source":{"line":6,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_remediation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"已记录的拒绝类别是岗位或权限不符；案卷没有可供对照的新旧职权条款。","text_sha256":"46fd6c59769f7d5aa4378b1638012bb3b1edc4943a847059696e5819b721f80f","visible_event_keys":["zg361workforceremediationfact.1"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361workforceremediationfact.1.reason_unknown","source":{"line":8,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_remediation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"来源没有保留有效的拒绝类别，也没有任何可供复核的整改条款。","text_sha256":"0a9221003936936e858a54009805a979d7676912416928eb7774c5b6b146742b","visible_event_keys":["zg361workforceremediationfact.1"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361workforceremediationfact.1.t","source":{"line":2,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_remediation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"遭拒的编制仍在冻结","text_sha256":"ea042ecb17424f78801eb6d80ae36a15ce75fde40a1433406251d2f7e032b139","visible_event_keys":["zg361workforceremediationfact.1"],"visible_event_roles":["title"]},{"key":"zg361wpf.2.a","source":{"line":10,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_probation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"记下任职结局与后续复核归属。","text_sha256":"18570e1e59b74283d089d78e7c2ae6bb1f47ba452c9c368df5c750a60472a7bb","visible_event_keys":["zg361wpf.2"],"visible_event_roles":["option"]},{"key":"zg361wpf.2.desc","source":{"line":3,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_probation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"你的试任期已经结束。官署正用实际任职结果复核当初的录用判断。","text_sha256":"3f9535a781c135bd95d8ceb05ad6cfb561d31f27770f084f313ad6a1b3ef096d","visible_event_keys":["zg361wpf.2"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361wpf.2.followup_accountability","source":{"line":9,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_probation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"官署会把这份结论归入最终任命决定者的责任记录。","text_sha256":"32faccc13165207f0747990bffd61f3afe379659f724211b2022c0ef7662a472","visible_event_keys":["zg361wpf.2"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361wpf.2.followup_evidence","source":{"line":8,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_probation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"官署会把这份结论与当初面试采用的证据逐项对照，用来复核那次判断是否可靠。","text_sha256":"0c4e4dd8cb6dea4eee64252be739b1b8593eea775f2faed88bfc92e453cc27fd","visible_event_keys":["zg361wpf.2"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361wpf.2.quality_attrition","source":{"line":6,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_probation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"你在任命后正常离任，离任补偿与职位释放均已确认；这次结局记为自然流失。","text_sha256":"fddc18799821bb2d2b302fb4c135681306e98c7b6205b0b4138357d5fa101ff9","visible_event_keys":["zg361wpf.2"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361wpf.2.quality_mismatch","source":{"line":5,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_probation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"改进期结束时，你的表现仍未达到要求；这次结局记为岗位不匹配，不算正常离任。","text_sha256":"8182d256dd23e367bf070a111c59c73f68ae851dbfd8623427e4dae8034a143e","visible_event_keys":["zg361wpf.2"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361wpf.2.quality_pass","source":{"line":4,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_probation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"后续考核表明，你的任职表现达到了岗位要求。","text_sha256":"fcbddfb5a38fe7eafd1e1f35d31cfe02f3499f97fd6f22baecd7f29791e27549","visible_event_keys":["zg361wpf.2"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361wpf.2.quality_role_change","source":{"line":7,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_probation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"你因任职变动离开原岗位；这次结局既不算绩效失败，也不计入自然流失。","text_sha256":"e67472698b54ed7eefd87c2863300e9cab0552ce9d0c6a13ff5a1365bc123f7d","visible_event_keys":["zg361wpf.2"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361wpf.2.t","source":{"line":2,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_probation_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"试用期结局回执","text_sha256":"df413fd14981cd1e387aa257a0e624e05ae8397bf54783a91ab963352df329c3","visible_event_keys":["zg361wpf.2"],"visible_event_roles":["title"]},{"key":"zg361wrf.1.a","source":{"line":4,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_rehire_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"旧账不删，新账照算。","text_sha256":"1a35c83735059d24a7592d88e1bcfd9989d64c19cf5d8e985d1f5b15e9de4d6d","visible_event_keys":["zg361wrf.1"],"visible_event_roles":["option"]},{"key":"zg361wrf.1.desc","source":{"line":3,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_rehire_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"旧离任案、绩效改进计划引用与后来真实绩效证据均已保留。回聘只开启未来考察，不会清零原先的末档考核结论，也不会凭新成果自动保送。","text_sha256":"a725356a6c49cff70591ff919d9d943d2aa6b74002bfafc6cea49b01e7153126","visible_event_keys":["zg361wrf.1"],"visible_event_roles":["description"]},{"key":"zg361wrf.1.t","source":{"line":2,"path":"mod_zhongguo_style/localization/simp_chinese/zg361_workforce_rehire_fact_l_simp_chinese.yml"},"text":"回聘履历封存","text_sha256":"80004706025e2afba79c92f9a1735e4904e191d3b82df3c109c1ccf8fe67b3bd","visible_event_keys":["zg361wrf.1"],"visible_event_roles":["title"]}],"schema_version":1}
